OL,3,GNEWSAThree vehicles seized from illegal
OL,4,Acar meet
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree vehicles have been seized after
OL,7,Fpolice attended an illegal car cruising
OL,8,Fevent in Telford.
OL,10,FOfficers found about 80 vehicles at
OL,11,FStafford Park on Sunday evening and
OL,12,Fabout 50 people gathered on foot, West
OL,13,FMerica Police said.
OL,15,FThe force added that it had received a
OL,16,Fnumber of reports from members of the
OL,17,Fpublic about cars allegedly racing
OL,18,Facross the town, which were believed to
OL,19,Fbe linked to the meet on the industrial
OL,20,Festate.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
