OL,3,GNEWSAThree vehicles seized from illegal
OL,4,Acar meet
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe vehicles were seized under section
OL,7,F59 of the Police Reform Act relating to
OL,8,Fanti-social driving as part of
OL,9,FOperation Chicane, which aims to tackle
OL,10,Fillegal car meets linked to anti-social
OL,11,Fbehaviour and dangerous driving across
OL,12,Fthe town.
